      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1379151979,
      "text": "Amomyrtus luma, known as luma, is a species of tree in the family Myrtaceae. It is native to Chile and Argentina. It grows from Colchagua to Aysen. This species occurs in rainforests, near streams, and in other moist sites."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Amomyrtus luma",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amomyrtus_luma",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 175363126,
      "text": "La luma o luma colorada es una especie de árbol perennifolio siempreverde de la familia de las mirtáceas. Crece en los bosques templados de Chile y de Argentina."
    }
